OL,3,GNEWSADriver banned after crashing bus
OL,4,Ainto bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver who crashed a
OL,7,Fdouble-decker bus into a bridge,
OL,8,Fcausing a grandmother to suffer a
OL,9,Ffractured jaw, has been banned from
OL,10,Fdriving for a year.
OL,12,FNeil Tuttlebee was driving a Reading
OL,13,FBuses service from Reading to Woodley
OL,14,Fon 9 March when he took a wrong turn
OL,15,Fand hit the bridge in Loddon Bridge
OL,16,FRoad.
OL,18,FThe force of the impact caused the
OL,19,Fwoman in her 80s to hit her face on a
OL,20,Fmetal pole. She lost a tooth and could
OL,21,Fnot eat solid food for 13 weeks,
OL,22,FReading Magistrates' Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
